      "comment": "REDEEMER'S WAY (7) was below best last time finishing fourth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Grade 5 win two back at Q Straight. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. YAPPING ACES (4) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 300m at Q Straight in a respectable 16.55 on September 21. Has the ability and looks a key chance. BROTHER RONNY (1) has mixed form recently, finishing sixth (20.61) in a Grade 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. CANYA CURRENCY (2) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
